  "snp5.17:1.1": "abalo vītavaṇṇo, ",
  "snp5.17:1.2": "icc-āyasmā Piṅgiyo ",
  "snp5.17:1.3": "nettā na suddhā, savanaṃ na phāsu, ",
  "snp5.17:1.4": "māhaṃ nassaṃ momuho antarāya, ",
  "snp5.17:1.5": "ācikkha dhammaṃ, yam ahaṃ vijaññaṃ ",
  "snp5.17:1.6": "jātijarāya idha vippahānaṃ\". 1121. ",
  "snp5.17:2.1": "\"Disvāna rūpesu vihaññamāne, ",
  "snp5.17:2.2": "Piṅgiyā ti Bhagavā ",
  "snp5.17:2.3": "ruppanti rūpesu janā pamattā, -- ",
  "snp5.17:2.4": "tasmā tuvaṃ Piṅgiya appamatto ",
  "snp5.17:2.5": "jahassu rūpaṃ apunabbhavāya\". 1122. ",
  "snp5.17:3.1": "\"Disā catasso vidisā catasso ",
  "snp5.17:3.2": "uddhaṃ adho, dasa disatā imāyo,| ",
  "snp5.17:3.3": "na tuyhaṃ adiṭṭham asutaṃ-mutaṃ vā ",
  "snp5.17:3.4": "atho aviññātaṃ kiñcanam atthi loke: ",
  "snp5.17:3.5": "ācikkha dhammaṃ yam ahaṃ vijaññaṃ ",
  "snp5.17:3.6": "jātijarāya idha vippahānaṃ\". 1123. ",
  "snp5.17:4.1": "\"Taṇhādhipanne manuje pekkhamāno ",
  "snp5.17:4.2": "Piṅgiyā ti Bhagavā ",
  "snp5.17:4.3": "santāpajāte jarasā parete, -- ",
  "snp5.17:4.4": "tasmā tuvaṃ Piṅgiya appamatto ",
  "snp5.17:4.5": "jahassu taṇhaṃ apunabbhavāyā\" ti ",
  "snp5.17:4.6": "PIṄGIYAMĀṆAVAPUCCHĀ NIṬṬHITĀ. 18. Idam avoca "
}
